#: homepage/templates/homepage/homepage.html:25
msgid ""
"Offer what you don't need, wish for what you do. We suggest what fits nearby."
msgstr ""
"Ofrece lo que no necesitas, desea lo que sí. Te sugerimos lo que encaja "
